  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch water market survey and strategy on Kenya and East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By executing a market study, the goal is to determine opportunities and bottlenecks for the Dutch water sector in Kenya and East African Community (EAC) and to identify concrete steps for a coherent approach to serve concrete demand. This market survey provides a gap analysis of the needs in the Kenyan water market and how to fulfil these with the offerings of the Netherlands Topsector Water.</narrative>
  </description>
